   "text": "the Question │ Work │ Report workflow of Audience Report at any level:\nwhat each cell reads, how work links to a question (answers: on a Job\nor Task face, a need id like QK10.E1), the walk open → partial →\nanswered (no checked state: s21-D04), the report Page (Opening ·\nAnswer · Evidence · Limits · Next), its ## Figures and drawing; a\ncomments batch is a report kind",
